    <briefdescription>
<para>A pass manager to run a set of extra function passes if the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_should_run_extra_passes" kindref="compound">ShouldRunExtraPasses</ref> marker analysis is present. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows passes to request additional transformations on demand. An example is extra simplifications after loop-vectorization, if runtime checks have been added. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
